WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.738
Lab 2 is the live test stage itself.

2
00:00:02.738 --> 00:00:04.504
You need an Entra test tenant,

3
00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:08.039
an Azure test subscription
with Arc-enabled test servers,

4
00:00:08.039 --> 00:00:12.163
and a test Active Directory forest,
never production, plus the three

5
00:00:12.163 --> 00:00:17.024
identities and the objects the chapter
lists as made before the runbook starts.

6
00:00:17.024 --> 00:00:21.197
Load the test stage's settings,
sign in as the deploy identity,

7
00:00:21.197 --> 00:00:24.200
and run the pre-flight
check dry and then live.

8
00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:29.673
Then follow the twelve steps of Stage 1:
the baseline evidence, the HR middleware,

9
00:00:29.673 --> 00:00:34.814
dynamic rules, Lifecycle Workflows
created disabled, Group Policy as code,

10
00:00:34.814 --> 00:00:39.872
machine configuration in audit, Ansible
in check mode, the drift pipeline,

11
00:00:39.872 --> 00:00:45.262
the smoke test, the evidence package, the
rollback drill and the evidence check.

12
00:00:45.262 --> 00:00:50.463
To back it out, step eleven runs the rollback
written from the record, newest first.

13
00:00:50.463 --> 00:00:52.560
Nobody has run Lab 2 yet.
